     "            (\"Photons\",\"Electrons\",\"What particles make up light?\"),\n",
     "            (\"The equator\",\"The prime meridian\",\"Which imaginary line divides Earth into North and South?\"),\n",
     "            (\"The thyroid\",\"The adrenal\",\"Which gland regulates metabolism through hormone production?\"),\n",
